OL,3,GNEWSATourism tax backlash: 'Rothbury is
OL,4,Anot Edinburgh'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHotels and music venues have hit out a
OL,7,Fmayor's plans to introduce a tourism
OL,8,Ftax.
OL,10,FIn September, the government confirmed
OL,11,Fplans to allow local leaders to
OL,12,Fintroduce a levy targeted at tourists
OL,13,Fstaying in hotels, bed and breakfasts
OL,14,Fand other types of accommodation in
OL,15,Ftheir regions.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
