OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATourism tax backlash: 'Rothbury is
OL,4,Anot Edinburgh'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth East Mayor Kim McGuinness has
OL,7,Fsaid she will bring in the fee and it
OL,8,Fwould boost jobs, while Tees Valley
OL,9,FMayor Ben Houchen has said he will not.
OL,10,FLocal authorities within McGuinness's
OL,11,Fjurisdiction have also attacked plans
OL,12,Ffor the levy.
OL,14,FNewcastle music venue owner Kate
OL,15,FHodgkinson said McGuinness's tax plans
OL,16,Fwere ill-thought out, while Rothbury
OL,17,Flandlord Debbie Noble said they would
OL,18,Fput visitors off.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
